+    # rather than read off `venv.envs[0]` expecting `_vigen_regime`.
+    #
+    # P3 sets `_vigen_regime` inside RL-ViGen's `robo_make`. This adapter does not call that -- it
+    # calls `robosuitevgb.utils.make_env` directly (imported above as `_robo_make_env`), which P3
+    # does not patch. So `_vigen_regime` was never set on anything in this stack, `venv.envs[0]`
